# Project Context & Overview

## Project: Juno - AI Computer Use Agent

This is a **Tauri v2** desktop application that implements an AI-powered computer use agent with multi-agent orchestration capabilities. The system allows AI models to interact with and control computer interfaces through various automation tools.

## Core Functionality

### Current Features
- **AI Agent Integration**: Connects with various AI providers (Anthropic, OpenAI, etc.)
- **Computer Automation**: Mouse, keyboard, window management, and screenshot capabilities
- **Voice Control**: Whisper-based speech recognition and dictation
- **Text Editor Tools**: File operations, content editing, and text manipulation
- **Shell Command Execution**: System command automation
- **Multi-Provider Support**: Configurable AI model providers with API key management

### Architecture Overview
- **Frontend**: TypeScript/React with Tauri webview
- **Backend**: Rust with Tauri framework
- **Desktop Automation**: Custom MCP server for cross-platform automation
- **AI Integration**: Provider abstraction layer for multiple AI services
- **Voice Processing**: Local Whisper model integration

## Project Structure

### Key Directories
- **`src-tauri/`**: Rust backend implementation
  - **`src/agent/`**: AI agent core system and traits
  - **`src/agents/`**: Multi-agent orchestration system ✨ **NEW**
  - **`src/commands/`**: Tauri command handlers for frontend-backend communication
  - **`src/tools/`**: Automation tool implementations
  - **`mcp-server-os-level/`**: Cross-platform automation engine
- **`src/`**: Frontend React/TypeScript application
- **`.cursor/rules/`**: AI assistant rules and documentation
- **`tasks/`**: Project management and task tracking

### Configuration Files
- **[src-tauri/Cargo.toml](mdc:src-tauri/Cargo.toml)**: Rust dependencies and project configuration
- **[package.json](mdc:package.json)**: Node.js dependencies and scripts
- **[implementation-plan.md](mdc:implementation-plan.md)**: Multi-agent architecture roadmap

## Technical Stack

### Backend (Rust)
- **Tauri v2**: Cross-platform desktop framework
- **Tokio**: Async runtime
- **Serde**: Serialization/deserialization
- **Tracing**: Logging and observability
- **Computer-Use-AI-SDK**: Desktop automation engine

### Frontend (TypeScript)
- **React 18**: UI framework
- **Vite**: Build tool and dev server
- **TailwindCSS**: Styling framework
- **Tauri APIs**: Native system integration

### AI Integration
- **Anthropic Claude**: Primary AI provider
- **OpenAI**: Alternative provider support
- **Provider Abstraction**: Configurable model selection
- **Tool Calling**: Structured function calling interface

## Development Environment

### Platform Support
- **Primary**: macOS (darwin 24.2.0)
- **Shell**: Zsh (/bin/zsh)
- **Workspace**: `/Users/lmorrow/repo/dotdot`

### Build Requirements
- **Rust**: Latest stable (via ~/.cargo/bin/cargo)
